<title>USA: Cardiac Science names Cohen president.</title>
<headline>Cardiac Science names Cohen president.</headline>
<dateline>IRVINE, Calif. 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cardiac Science Inc said on Friday that it has named Raymond Cohen president and chief executive officer effective Feb. 20.</p>
<p>Cohen is currently the president of Diagnostic Monitoring, a privately held company that markets diagnostic cardiovascular equipment worldwide.</p>
<p>A company spokeswoman said that Cohen replaces Howard Cooper, who resigned in 1994. She said that since then, there has been an acting president.</p>
</text>
